                <h2>An ultra-modern school for a brighter future</h2>
                <p>Biggi Junior School is based in Pakwach. Established in 2022, we have grown to over 200 registered pupils, offering a full education from Nursery through Primary 7 in an environment built on discipline, care, and community.</p>
                <p>Our teachers and leadership work as one team to keep classrooms full of curiosity, and to make sure that a family's circumstances never decide whether a child gets to learn. Through fundraising and bursary support, we continue extending that promise to more children each year.</p>
                <div class="stat-row">
